      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports an urban design/build environment sense of “environmental modifications,” not a learning/psychology sense, so the field and requested sense are unsupported.",
        "The definition adds a broad general gloss (“deliberate changes to a physical setting to improve conditions for the people using it”) that is not directly established by the packet and goes beyond the specific wind-comfort interventions described there.",
        "The packet only supports a narrow example involving outdoor residential spaces, walls, enclosed spaces, and windbreak plants in one study; it does not support presenting these as the definition of the term in general."
